# Cursor Rules: Balance Diet Pune
- App Router, React 19 Server Components first, Tailwind CSS v4.
- Direct & concise responses.
- NEVER add decorative rounded capsule/pill badges above section headings (e.g. `[✨ text • text]`, `[🛡️ text • text]`).
- Do not read heavy artifacts like package-lock.json or .next/.

